  fullPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a5c3cd02733bc4943ba0e875a794c4b3, type: 3}
  skillCategory: The Pale
  skillName: 
  skillInfo: Attain internal awareness.  Know thyself.
  skillStats1: 'Pale Base: '
  skillStats2: 'Learned Skill:'
  skillStats3: 'Bonus from Item:'
  skillDescription: From the bead of sweat tha gathers at your brow, the shiver that
    races through your spine, or the iron wall erected in protection of the more
    sensitive parts of your mind, you know precisely who and what you are.  Such
    is your defense against that which seeks to bring you to your knees.  Directly
    tied to resolve, self-actualization is your last mental line of defense.  Ever
    now and then, however, an intruder must enter the gate.
  categoryLevel: 0
  skillLevel: 0
