  skillCategory: NeoMammalian Complex
  skillName: 
  skillInfo: See what others do not.  Pierce the scene with eyes alone.
  skillStats1: 'NeoMammalian Base: '
  skillStats2: 'Learned Skill:'
  skillStats3: 'Bonus from Item:'
  skillDescription: Four-eyes was never an insult to you.  It was the greatest compliment
    that could be delivered, the extra pair precisely what is required to pick up
    that singular detail that makes all the difference.  The crack in a vase, the
    bulge in somebody's coat pocket, you see more of others than even they see of
    themselves.
